  "body": "What is missing: `crates/app/src/operation/params.rs` has about 1780 lines. The rule is no source file past about 400 lines.\n\nEvidence: `wc -l crates/app/src/operation/params.rs` gives 1778 on main. No open issue tracks a split of this file.\n\nFound in the review of PR #518.\n\nDone means: the file is split along the domain seams into files of about 400 lines or less. The public paths stay the same through re-exports. The `#[test]` count does not change. The quick gate is green.\n",
